---
import DefaultPageLayout from "../../layouts/DefaultPageLayout.astro";
import Petapetual from "../../components/Petapetual.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<DefaultPageLayout
    title="For Forgotten Culture"
    description="Unsure how to honour your loved ones according to tradition? Petapetual offers guided options so you can pay respects meaningfully, even without deep cultural knowledge."
>
    <article class="article-container">
        <a href="/examples" class="back-link">
            <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> All Use Cases
        </a>

        <Image
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1641644239376-52e9952a43a6?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1674"
            alt="Over time, culture erodes and traditions slowly become forgotten. Petapetual's value also comes in the form of education: if you don't know what to do to pay respects, we have your back!"
            class="article-hero"
            width="1674"
            height="400"
        />

        <h1 class="article-title">
            <Petapetual /> for those disconnected from their culture
        </h1>

        <p class="article-text">
            As the world becomes more modern, many traditional rites and
            practices are slowly being forgotten. If you want to honour the
            dearly departed but aren't sure what prayers to say, what offerings
            to give, or what traditions to observe—you're not alone.
        </p>

        <p class="article-text">
            <Petapetual /> is here to help. We believe that paying respects shouldn't
            require expertise. Our platform offers a variety of <a
                href="/how-it-works/prayer-streams"
                class="article-link">prayer streams</a
            > and <a href="/how-it-works/tributes" class="article-link"
                >tributes</a
            > from different traditions, so you can choose what feels right for you
            and your loved one.
        </p>

        <h2 class="article-subtitle">No expertise required</h2>

        <p class="article-text">
            You don't need to know the intricacies of Buddhist mantras,
            Christian prayers, or Taoist blessings. Simply browse the options
            available and select the ones that resonate with you. Whether you
            want to honour your loved one's heritage or find something that
            feels personally meaningful, the choice is yours.
        </p>

        <p class="article-text">
            Each prayer stream and tribute is clearly labelled with its
            tradition, so you can explore and learn as you go. There's no
            pressure to get it "right"—what matters is your intention to
            remember and honour.
        </p>

        <h2 class="article-subtitle">Something for everyone</h2>

        <p class="article-text">
            Our platform includes options across multiple traditions: Buddhist,
            Christian, Taoist, and more. We also offer culturally agnostic
            options for those who prefer something universal. If you're
            memorialising a pet, we have tributes designed specifically for
            animal companions too.
        </p>

        <p class="article-text">
            Not sure where to start? Create your memorial and explore.
            You can add prayers and tributes at any time, and you're never
            locked into a single tradition.
        </p>

        <div class="article-cta">
            <a href="https://app.petapetual.com" class="cta-btn">
                Create a Memorial <i class="fas fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i>
            </a>
        </div>
    </article>
</DefaultPageLayout>

<style>
    @reference "tailwindcss";

    .article-container {
        @apply flex flex-col gap-6;
    }

    .back-link {
        @apply text-sm no-underline transition-colors;
        color: var(--color-pp-mid);
    }

    .back-link:hover {
        color: var(--color-pp-primary);
    }

    .article-hero {
        @apply w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-sm;
        @apply lg:h-72;
    }

    .article-title {
        @apply text-2xl font-bold;
        @apply lg:text-3xl;
        color: var(--color-pp-primary);
    }

    .article-subtitle {
        @apply text-xl font-semibold mt-2;
        color: var(--color-pp-primary);
    }

    .article-text {
        @apply leading-relaxed;
        color: var(--color-pp-dark);
    }

    .article-link {
        @apply underline transition-colors;
        color: var(--color-pp-primary);
        text-decoration-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-pp-primary) 50%, transparent);
    }

    .article-link:hover {
        text-decoration-color: var(--color-pp-primary);
    }

    .article-cta {
        @apply mt-4 py-8 text-center;
        border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-pp-mid) 30%, transparent);
    }

    .cta-btn {
        @apply inline-block px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold no-underline transition-colors;
        background-color: var(--color-pp-primary);
        color: var(--color-pp-light);
    }

    .cta-btn:hover {
        opacity: 0.9;
    }
</style>
